sequenceDiagram

    Actor Anon as Anonymous User
    participant UI as Client UI
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant AS as Auth Service
    participant TS as ThreadService
    participant DB as Database


    activate UI

    opt user first opens thread list in a session

    Anon->> UI: 1. requestThreadList()
    UI->>API: 2. GET /api/threads/get_all_threads
    activate API
    API->>TS: 3. getAllThreads()
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: 4. SELECT * FROM threads
    activate DB
    DB-->>TS: 5. {thread rows}
    deactivate DB
    TS-->>API: 6. Thread Array
    deactivate TS
    API-->>UI: 7. 200 OK (ThreadList)
    deactivate API
    UI-->>Anon: 8. sendThreadList(threads)

    end

    Anon->>UI: 9. requestThreadMessages(thread_id)
    UI->>API: 10. GET /api/threads/{id}/messages
    activate API
    API->>TS: 11. getThreadMessages(thread_id)
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: 12. SELECT * FROM messages WHERE thread_id = thread_id
    activate DB
    DB-->>TS: 13. {message rows}
    deactivate DB
    TS-->>API: 14. Message Array
    deactivate TS
    API-->>UI: 15. 200 OK (MessageList)
    deactivate API

    loop for each message received
    UI-->>Anon: 16. Display Message
    end

    UI-->>Anon: 17. Display textbox and send button
    UI-->>Anon: 18. Disply textboxes for username and tripcode

    deactivate UI
